[C][*/] But  [Cmaj7][*/]  don't  [C7][*/] for-[F]get who's taking you home
and in whose arms you're [C] going to be
Oh [G7] darlin', save the last dance for [C] me

{comment:  Verse 2}
Oh I [C] know ... that the music's fine, 
Like sparkling wine, go and [G7] have your fun 
